ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X9XKtht9lJoQ7kNvwEi3Ate&_nc_oc=AdoZ1pqP1MvpWufKoqulbpEUcsoWa8XWnqJtPZAWH2OAa5nYOj-8_q4xp-7aY5Plox0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN9DTFDf0uMlvqkRkfSRt5twpBE4Wg6BJswxX4FDsldUg&oe=6AD3927C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yMRBDCN4jAoQ7kNvwG1uAXf&_nc_oc=AdqcoIH7vljuFb8GovWCIDUtTBwIAgN44vLah5AzEQOvVyXpG7RPT7GnbnqnENhqAXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOiBJznVPglhTSTs7H8UPlb-zsX6sxKVeinycnk9mV-gw&oe=6AD3AED6"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=72WuXMXOpMEQ7kNvwHyWl00&_nc_oc=Adodzai-5-wZ8vU8uVX-7mlTcULKfxJtqcMTFolzHl814q0wKkI0fUnLfTZOCvjUA7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOA6I1Q5XyOhloLQ-cHDsZRtJiXxM-3Lls-XGbZn8vsbA&oe=6AD3BCA4"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_